<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A+ to Citicorp dual samurai.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A+ to Citicorp dual samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it had assigned its A+ rating to Citicorp's 25 billion yen 5.4 percent dual-currency yen/dollar bond issue due April 18, 2000.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
